    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GG-Party</strong> is the ultimate open-world party game for up to 8 players! Grab your crew, pick your favorite color, and jump in - the rule is simple: the first to become a millionaire wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Never seen before:</strong> No more boring dice board games! Watching 7 other players roll the dice is a thing of the past. Welcome to the future of party games. GG-Party is a fresh party game packed with open-world vibes. You're not just watching - you're right in the middle of the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0d <strong>GG-Party Mode</strong><br>Explore a vibrant open world, take on wild quests, and invest your hard-earned cash wisely in real estate and shops. Upgrade your basic houses with mining GPUs to generate continuous income - but be warned: sabotaged houses without power will suffer rent reductions, and GPUs don\u2019t mine without electricity. Makes sense, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every 5 minutes, you\u2019ll get the chance to earn extra cash in exciting minigames. Play smart and strategic - the first player to hit millionaire status takes over the island and wins! And yes, making your friends' lives difficult is definitely part of the fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fresh Ideas &amp; Retro Vibes:</strong><br>Our minigames mix nostalgia with new concepts. Whether it's wild design, creative rules, or brilliant genre mashups - you\u2019ll find familiar classics with a whole new twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Current Minigames:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Paintball:</strong> Pure FPS action with modes like Last Man Standing, Most Kills in Time, or First to 10 Kills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bomber Dudes:</strong> Blow up your opponents (or yourself) - Last Man Standing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Run:</strong> Run for your life! Who\u2019s the fastest in this parkour race?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Helicopter:</strong> Intense air combat with multiple modes: Last Man Standing, Most Kills in Time, or First to 10 Kills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>RC Monster Trucks:</strong> Off-road racing with mini trucks. Will you be the first to cross the finish line?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tanks:</strong> Arena action with heavy artillery in various game modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hoverboards:</strong> Speed through awesome tracks and leave everyone in the dust!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Camper Wash:</strong> Funnier than it sounds - who can scrub their camper clean the fastest?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Quads:</strong> Adrenaline-pumping four-wheel madness. Step on it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Jet Ski:</strong> Pure water fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mini Golf:</strong> Relaxed but no less competitive. Sink that shot and show your friends who's boss!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>And the best part?</strong><br>Over 30 more minigames are already in the works for 2026 and 2027 - but for now, our full focus is on the open-world experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019ve also got two more game modes in store:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Minigame Mode:</strong> Choose your favorite game and show your friends who\u2019s boss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Tournament Mode:</strong> Compete in a marathon of minigames - after each round, vote on the next game. Collect the most money cases and claim the win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019re just getting started: <strong>GG-Party</strong> is constantly growing. New modes, new minigames, new features - the fun never ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So what are you waiting for? Gather your friends, grab a controller, and show us what you\u2019ve got!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Developer Insider:</strong><br>Our artists are designing unique characters and levels - no asset flips, just pure originality. GG-Party will be a treat for the eyes and your funny bone. Let\u2019s go!</p>",
